    feat: add alembic migrations
    
    CHANGES:
    - added a top layer, for the migrations. this is alembic and itensures I
      donthave to fiddle with SQL queries on each instance. this is better
      though I actaully did like working with SQL :/
    - I have used mariadb(mysql) and not postgres, which is an industry
      standard at this point. I like working with databases inthe cli, and
      this is how I learnt to work with them. postgres's weird queries like
      "\d", "\dt", "\q" make absolutely no sense to make. I like the other
      sql-based DBMS syntax like "show tables" etc...
    
    CONSIDERATIONS:
    - learn alembic deeply, this was a brief overview, not that deep. I know
      how tomake it work but not enough!

