    feat: setup password reset flow
    
    CHANGES:
    - add the password reset dataflow, both within the application if a user
      remember their password and wants to change it, or outside of the
      application, if a user forgot their password and want to setup a new one
      to login.
    - this utilizes tokens for security and works as a background task to
      prevent holding up system resources
    - this workflow workr both in the frontend and application, or simply
      using the "/docs" endpoints.
    
    CONSIDERATIONS:
    - used Resed, which is a Sass, thatallows easy sending and receiving of
      emails. it only donwfall isthat one can only send emails from the
      email they registered with, up until you officially register a
      separate domain and use that as the "MAIL_FROM" in your ".env" file.
    - As such, I think its a good idea to roll with gmail(google) based smtp
      server, upuntil you officially register your own domain name, and can
      now send emails tomore people flexibly.

