commit 3bd831758d83984d3f01a63262b188120d2fddfb
Author: mbvgua <mbvgua+dev@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 22 13:29:11 2026 +0300

    feat(async): made app async
    
    CHANGES:
    - changed the database to use asynchronous methods and sessions, this in
      turn caused me to use async routes within the application. ensured
      eager loading and fastAPI exception handlers!
    
    CONSIDERATIONS:
    - async really provides subliminal API speed gains in small standalone
      API's, it instead begins to shine in large-scale concurrent
      applications. FastAPI is also able to handle both sync and async
      request at the same time!
    - do not use blocking modules in async requests, such as 'requests'
      library. instead look for async ones such as 'httpx'

